      "promptEs": "de vuelta a + lugar",
      "questionEn": "How do you say that someone or something is going back to a place?",
      "answerEn": "Use de vuelta a before the destination or place.",
      "noteEn": "De vuelta presents a return, and a introduces the place being returned to. If that place starts with el, a + el contracts to al: de vuelta al trabajo.",
